    modified_response: "I have applied the **Professional Polish** design theme across the entire LokalSwap application while strictly preserving all existing components, HTML structures, and features.\n\n### Aesthetic & Styling Updates\n- **Clean Palette & Typography**: Transformed backgrounds to a crisp slate canvas (`bg-slate-50`) paired with slate-900 typography, indigo accent elements, and subtle `slate-200` borders.\n- **Header Refinement**: Re-styled the header with a clean white backdrop, indigo brand icon (`bg-indigo-600`), and subtle metadata badges for regional catalogs and document formats.\n- **Form & Upload Controls**: Redesigned the demo presets, dropzone, text areas, and select menus with rounded corners (`rounded-xl` / `rounded-md`), subtle borders, and indigo primary action controls.\n- **Visual Diff Highlights**: Maintained clear green highlight badges (`bg-emerald-100`) for cultural replacements while wrapping the diff containers in high-contrast slate cards.\n- **Translation & Export Cards**: Styled the Mother Tongue translation card and export controls with slate cards, indigo action buttons, and copy/download indicators."
